WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.270
Start each day with a

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:02.680
quick check in AutoLander.

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.480
Confirm Facebook is connected,

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.070
your inventory is right,

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:07.100
and any unfinished

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.400
Queue items make sense.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:10.480
If you're using Auto-Pilot,

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.760
check that it's on and

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.060
the app can keep running.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:14.500
If you work manually,

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:15.840
choose the vehicles you

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.030
want to post and review

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.050
Listing Updates.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.300
Then check Facebook Messenger.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.920
That's where shopper

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.320
conversations come to you.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.710
AutoLander handles

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:25.770
the posting routine;

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:27.390
you handle the conversation.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.260
Open Messenger on

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:30.480
your computer or phone,

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.580
and keep notifications on so

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.820
you notice new questions.

00:00:34.223 --> 00:00:35.823
Before you finish your shift,

00:00:35.883 --> 00:00:37.743
check remaining work and any

00:00:37.743 --> 00:00:39.383
messages you promise to answer.
